      en: { q: "Put the levels of Maslow's hierarchy of needs in order from the bottom (most urgent) to the top.", o: ["Basic needs", "Safety", "Social needs", "Esteem", "Self-actualisation"], e: "Basic needs (food, drink, sleep) must be met first, followed by safety, social needs, esteem and, at the very top, self-actualisation." },
